WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.500 --> 00:00:02.700
If there is tape —

2
00:00:02.748 --> 00:00:05.100
keep the area dry until three days after

3
00:00:05.170 --> 00:00:07.660
surgery, and do not clean it before then.

4
00:00:07.953 --> 00:00:09.820
If there is no tape —

5
00:00:09.873 --> 00:00:12.460
clean the edges gently twice a day with

6
00:00:12.513 --> 00:00:16.540
equal parts hydrogen peroxide and distilled water, then

7
00:00:16.593 --> 00:00:19.900
apply an antibiotic ointment such as bacitracin.
